<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#081426">
<title>Elite Company | Payment Information</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    background: #081426;
    color: #f5f8fc;
    padding: 22px 14px;
}

.container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: auto;
}

.header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #293b52;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.brand {
    color: #00dfa0;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
}

.department {
    color: #9aadc1;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 7px;
}

.reference {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #9aadc1;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.card {
    background: #112139;
    border: 1px solid #293f59;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.topline {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 23px;
}

.label {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #a9bacd;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.status {
    background: #183e35;
    color: #70e6b8;
    border: 1px solid #286b55;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 26px;
    margin-bottom: 13px;
}

.intro {
    color: #b7c6d8;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.amount-panel {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,#103331,#10283c);
    border: 1px solid #28634f;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 26px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 25px;
}

.amount-title {
    color: #b5c9c5;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.amount {
    color: #00e5a0;
    font-size: 37px;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-top: 12px;
}

.section-title {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #293f59;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.detail {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
    padding: 15px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #293b50;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.detail:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
}

.detail-name {
    color: #a9bacd;
}

.detail-value {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: bold;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.green {
    color: #64e8b6;
}

.orange {
    color: #ffd078;
}

.phone-box {
    background: #0b1b2d;
    border: 1px solid #285344;
    border-radius: 11px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 18px;
}

.phone-label {
    color: #9aadc1;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.phone-number {
    color: #00e5a0;
    font-size: 27px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.network {
    color: #b5c6d6;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
}

.notice {
    background: #30291e;
    border: 1px solid #66552f;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.notice h3 {
    color: #ffd078;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.notice p {
    color: #e3d9c8;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.next-step {
    background: #0b1b2d;
    border-left: 3px solid #00dfa0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 18px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.next-step h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.next-step p {
    color: #b7c6d8;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.print-button {
    width: 100%;
    border: none;
    background: #00d994;
    color: #071b15;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 23px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.print-button:hover {
    background: #48efb8;
}

.footer {
    text-align: center;
    color: #8498ae;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    padding: 20px 10px;
}

.footer strong {
    color: #00dfa0;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

@media(max-width:480px) {
    .brand {font-size: 20px;}
    .card {padding: 19px;}
    h1 {font-size: 23px;}
    .amount {font-size: 31px;}
    .phone-number {font-size: 24px;}
    .reference {font-size: 9px;}
}

@media print {
    body {
        background: white;
        color: #111;
    }
    .card {
        background: white;
        color: #111;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .intro, .detail-name, .next-step p,
    .notice p, .footer {
        color: #444;
    }
    .print-button {
        display: none;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<header class="header">
    <div>
        <div class="brand">ELITE COMPANY</div>
        <div class="department">
            FINANCE & PAYMENTS DEPARTMENT
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reference">
        PAYMENT INFORMATION<br>
        2026
    </div>
</header>

<main>

<section class="card">

    <div class="topline">
        <span class="label">WINNING PAYMENT UPDATE</span>
        <span class="status">INFORMATION RECEIVED</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Dear James Mwangi,</h1>

    <p class="intro">
        We are pleased to provide an update regarding
        your recorded winning funds under your Elite
        Company account. Your submitted payment and
        transfer information has been received for
        final verification.
    </p>

    <div class="amount-panel">
        <div class="amount-title">
            RECORDED WINNING FUNDS
        </div>
        <div class="amount">KSh 245,000+</div>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="card">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        01. Account Information
    </h2>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Account Holder</span>
        <span class="detail-value">James Mwangi</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Company</span>
        <span class="detail-value">Elite Company</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Currency</span>
        <span class="detail-value">Kenyan Shillings (KES)</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Recorded Amount</span>
        <span class="detail-value green">KSh 245,000+</span>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="card">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        02. Payment Verification
    </h2>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Payment Information</span>
        <span class="detail-value green">Received</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Transfer Information</span>
        <span class="detail-value orange">Under Review</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Final Disbursement</span>
        <span class="detail-value orange">Not Confirmed</span>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="card">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        03. Proposed Company Charge
    </h2>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Proposed Tax / Charge</span>
        <span class="detail-value orange">KSh 1,340</span>
    </div>

    <div class="notice">
        <h3>Important Financial Notice</h3>
        <p>
            Any proposed tax or administrative charge
            must be supported by an official assessment,
            applicable tax documentation and a verifiable
            payment reference. Verify the charge before
            making any payment.
        </p>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="card">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        04. Proposed Recipient Details
    </h2>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Recipient</span>
        <span class="detail-value">James Mwangi</span>
    </div>

    <div class="detail">
        <span class="detail-name">Mobile Network</span>
        <span class="detail-value green">Safaricom</span>
    </div>

    <div class="phone-box">
        <div class="phone-label">
            PROPOSED M-PESA DESTINATION
        </div>

        <div class="phone-number">
            0722430322
        </div>

        <div class="network">
            Safaricom Mobile Money
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="notice">
        <h3>Destination Verification</h3>
        <p>
            The above number is the proposed recipient
            destination. Confirm ownership and authorization
            before initiating a transfer. Its inclusion
            does not confirm receipt or release of funds.
        </p>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="card">

    <h2 class="section-title">
        05. Next Steps
    </h2>

    <div class="next-step">
        <h3>Final Verification & Disbursement</h3>
        <p>
            Following completion of legitimate verification
            requirements, the company should communicate
            the approved transfer method and expected
            disbursement timeline to James Mwangi.
        </p>
    </div>

    <button class="print-button"
        onclick="window.print()">
        PRINT PAYMENT INFORMATION
    </button>

</section>

</main>

<footer class="footer">
    <strong>ELITE COMPANY</strong><br>
    Finance & Payments Department<br>
    © 2026 Elite Company. All Rights Reserved.<br><br>
    Informational notice only. This document is not
    proof of funds, a tax invoice, or confirmation
    of an actual money transfer.
</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
